/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A Canadian company that's changing the game when it comes to sustainable living and ethical future. Our passion for natural farming practices and fair-trade principles shines through in every aspect of our business.Our Farm-to-Fork strategy ensures traceability, fair trade, and natural excellence. With our subscription-based approach and Direct-to-Consumers convenience, we empower individuals to make conscious choices, supporting local farmers and fostering a healthier planet for all)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
