/ActualText (Traceability is at the core of our commitment to transparency and quality. Through our advanced food tracking system, we provide consumers with the ability to trace the journey of their food, from the farms where it was grown to the table where it is enjoyed. This traceability ensures that our customers have complete visibility into the origin, handling, shipping and certification status of the products they purchase. )
/Pg 8 0 R
