<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our story starts with a group of local farmers who cultivate naturally and organically. These farmers faced a difficult challenge - how to get their products to consumers in a fair and sustainable way. We recognized their struggle and knew that we could make a difference.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We started by helping these farmers with fair prices and providing guidance, teaching them about the latest technology and methods to sell their products. This created a strong partnership between us and the farmers, allowing us to offer the highest quality, 100% natural products to our customers.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As a start-up in Canada, we faced our own challenges, including how to bring our natural products to a larger audience. We saw a need for a technological revolution in the natural food industry - one that would allow us to offer authentic, natural products on a global platform.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
