/ActualText (Traceability for natural products is the ability to track and trace the origin, movement, and handling of an natural product through the supply chain. It provides a comprehensive record of the product's journey, including information about its origin, handling,  shipping and certification status.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
