261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We observed some challenges in tracking and traceability of fair trade, pure natural Organic products such as complex supply chain, lack of standardization, inconsistent quality, certifications fraud, limited technological infrastructure. These challenges can make it difficult for consumers to trust that the natural products they purchase have been produced in an ethical and sustainable manner. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We concluded that implementing effective traceability systems can help to address these issues and promote transparency in the supply chain.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
